    "detailed_description": "KEYTRON: Typer &amp; Shooter is a unique blend of fast-paced arcade action and keyboard training \u2013 instead of traditional weapons you wield words! In Text Typing Mode, you race against the clock, practicing your WPM and checking detailed stats after each run, while in Word Shooting Mode you eliminate incoming targets by typing them accurately and quickly. The dynamic visuals with neon outlines, particle effects, and backgrounds that react to your shots create an immersive atmosphere, and a precise scoring system lets you track your progress in every session. By joining now, you support KEYTRON\u2019s development in Early Access and help shape its final form!",
    "about_the_game": "KEYTRON: Typer &amp; Shooter is a unique blend of fast-paced arcade action and keyboard training \u2013 instead of traditional weapons you wield words! In Text Typing Mode, you race against the clock, practicing your WPM and checking detailed stats after each run, while in Word Shooting Mode you eliminate incoming targets by typing them accurately and quickly. The dynamic visuals with neon outlines, particle effects, and backgrounds that react to your shots create an immersive atmosphere, and a precise scoring system lets you track your progress in every session. By joining now, you support KEYTRON\u2019s development in Early Access and help shape its final form!",
    "short_description": "Test your reflexes and typing speed in KEYTRON: Typer &amp; Shooter\u2014type words at lightning pace before time runs out and shatter your own high scores! Jump in now and dive into the neon-fueled action that makes every keystroke pulse with excitement.",
